[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13323.79, "timestamp": "03:42:03", "text": "你沒有違反公司的任何規定，而且你一直做得很好，但由於某些原因你必須離開，並且這是你的最終決定，那麼他們不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13326.67, "timestamp": "03:42:06", "text": "解僱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13335.83, "timestamp": "03:42:15", "text": "你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13340.229, "timestamp": "03:42:20", "text": "。是的，他們會這樣寫，他們會接受，他們會難過地看到你離開，但他們仍然會尊重你"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13342.087, "timestamp": "03:42:22", "author": "@adrianspiritflame", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/eaPxeLg6RZ3xDUjR-MtIoERS88UVLefuyFlCSftVUSaisdxANdt8HVouIGg2eSadWXpWoxIB5HA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "well ill be lurking for the rest of the stream 👀"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13350.469, "timestamp": "03:42:30", "text": "。是的，我們在11號大廳看到過很多次山治"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13366.034, "timestamp": "03:42:46", "author": "@ArekuVT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/pqSduyGeea3diiqImLaqfTDN6g8f9g3gvrMGmIFqiGTP6ktehIf_rNzOg3vog72mKxfC-qSiBWQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ey"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13371.15, "timestamp": "03:42:51", "text": "。沒錯。我們也看到那些無意或故意違反規則的人，你知道，他們會被移除。記住，商業化的YouTube意味著你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13375.11, "timestamp": "03:42:55", "text": "沒有那麼多的自由，也就是說，你可以自由地製作任何內容，任何你想要的風格，但你必須先徵求上級的意見，看看是否可以這樣做。如果他們說不行，你就不能那樣做了。就是這樣，出於某些原因，你必須離開。他們會讓你離開，對吧？他們會讓你繼續做下去，但要遵守一些協議，像是我之前沒提到的。如果一家"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13375.567, "timestamp": "03:42:55", "author": "@ArekuVT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/pqSduyGeea3diiqImLaqfTDN6g8f9g3gvrMGmIFqiGTP6ktehIf_rNzOg3vog72mKxfC-qSiBWQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "seems joq is eepy ww"}]